    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can personalize learning by adapting explanations to a student’s level, providing instant feedback, and generating practice problems. They can also bridge gaps for students who struggle with abstract concepts, making complex topics more accessible through interactive examples."
